  "statement": "The EfficiencyAgent emphasizes the necessity of high performance and resource optimization in the RollCall system. Requirement EFF-01 ensures real-time data processing within 2 seconds, which is crucial for immediate attendance updates. EFF-02 guarantees support for at least 500 concurrent users, ensuring scalability. EFF-03 mandates report generation within 5 seconds for up to 1000 students, enhancing responsiveness. EFF-05 allows students to view their records promptly, and EFF-07 ensures a responsive user interface. Additionally, EFF-06 optimizes resource utilization through load balancing, making the system efficient across multiple classes and semesters.",
